# ---- Crowd creatures (client/crowd/README.md): models the vertex-animation baker reads. The Graves roster (crowd_looks.json enemy_model), then the Ossuary's and the Nave's:
slice/models/grave_robber
slice/models/bone_hound
slice/models/penitent
slice/models/barrow_ghoul
slice/models/skull_rat
# the Ossuary's two new kinds (the deacon and the golem; the rest of its roster is the Graves')
slice/models/deacon
slice/models/bone_golem
# the Drowned Nave's five (the censer, the acolyte, the gargoyle, the templar and the wraith, an unrigged prop like the moth; the rest of its roster is the Graves' and the Ossuary's)
